      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The target must succeed at a DC 20 Fortitude save or become enfeebled 1 (or enfeebled 2 on a critical hit) for 1 round. Lone exiles of yeti clans have little use for treasure and leave the gear of their slain victims behind where it is quickly covered by snowfall. Clan-based yetis, on the other hand, create beautifully carved stonework, some of which they shape into protective talismans of rare beauty."
